31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I have some really important news... I'm the Seer, and I checked Asuka last night. She's the werewolf!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"...What? Already? I... I can't believe it. Are you sure, Yumi?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,That is a very bold claim to make on the first day. It is far more likely that you are the werewolf attempting to frame me immediately.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, what a shocking start to the morning. Yumi dear, are you certain about what you saw?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"This is so sudden. Yumi, you're usually so cheerful, so I want to believe you, but Asuka seems very calm.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm absolutely sure! I'm the Seer, and the vision was clear. We have to vote for Asuka today so we can win!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If Yumi is telling the truth, we should listen... but if she's lying, we'll lose a villager. I'm so confused.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Precisely, Daisuke. Yumi is using her ""cheerful"" persona to manipulate your emotions. A real Seer would be more cautious about revealing themselves so early.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult position to be in. Asuka, do you have any evidence to prove your innocence, or are you simply denying the claim?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, you are very logical, but Yumi's claim is very direct. Why would she risk claiming Seer so quickly if she were the wolf?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"Exactly, Midori! If I were the wolf, I'd try to hide! Please, everyone, trust me! Let's get rid of the wolf now!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I trust Yumi. She's always been so honest and energetic. I'll vote for Asuka.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Trusting a teenager's intuition over logical caution is a mistake. I am a human. Yumi is the wolf, and she's trying to end the game in one turn.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel a great deal of sincerity from Yumi. It is a heavy decision, but I believe her heart is true.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm leaning toward Yumi as well. Asuka, your logic is sound, but Yumi's conviction is very strong.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Thank you everyone for trusting me! Let's do this! Vote for Asuka!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'm ready.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,You are making a grave error. You will regret this when the wolf attacks tonight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope for all our sakes that we are making the right choice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll vote with the group. I hope Yumi is right.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
